OL,3,AAustralia launches urgent review after
OL,4,AOpenAI program hacks government health
OL,5,Aportal
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralia has launched an urgent review
OL,8,Fafter an OpenAI agent "infiltrated"
OL,9,Fpart of the government's healthcare
OL,10,Fscheme Medicare - here's what we know
OL,12,FThe agent, which is an autonomous
OL,13,Fcomputer program, accessed the
OL,14,Fstatistics portal in June, PM Anthony
OL,15,FAlbanese says while at the UN General
OL,16,FAssembly (Unga)
OL,18,FTimeline of events: OpenAI became aware
OL,19,Fin August and told Australia's
OL,20,Fgovernment in September, via an email
OL,21,Fto a general government agency inbox
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
